            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This chapter describes two powerful 3D ligand-based shape similarity and scoring methods called ROCS and EON, their basic operation and selected validation data. The steps required to prepare a database of molecules for successful use with ROCS and EON are described and selected examples of their application in prospective lead discovery experiments are summarized.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
